## Project layout

| Folder         | Contents                                                                  |
| -------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------- |
| `data/raw/`    | Original, immutable data. Never edit these files by hand.                 |
| `data/interim/` | Intermediate data that has been transformed.                              |
| `data/processed/` | Final, analysis-ready data.                                            |
| `notebooks/`   | Exploratory and reporting notebooks.                                      |
| `src/`         | Reusable analysis code, imported by notebooks{% if with_snakemake %} and the workflow{% endif %}. |
| `results/`     | Generated figures and tables.                                             |
| `notes/`       | An [Obsidian](https://obsidian.md) vault with research notes.             |
| `literature/`  | Journal articles (PDFs stay local) and reference exports.                 |
{%- if with_snakemake %}
| `workflow/`    | The Snakemake workflow that reproduces the results.                       |
{%- endif %}
